implementationPlan.description:
Fix SnapshotComparison.tsx + PolicySnapshot type chain — 5 TypeScript errors + runtime bugs.

(a) **types.ts**: Add `version`, `createdBy`, `rules` to `PolicySnapshot` interface:
```
export interface PolicySnapshot extends PolicySnapshotSummary {
  bundles?: Record<string, unknown>;
  version?: number;
  createdBy?: string;
  rules?: PolicyRule[];
}
```

(b) **transform.ts**: Update `BackendPolicySnapshot` to include `version`, `created_by`. Update `mapPolicySnapshot` to extract `rules` from all bundles' YAML content. Backend stores bundles as `map[string]any` where each bundle has `content` (YAML string) with rules inside. Parse each bundle's `rules` array and flatten into snapshot's `rules` field.

(c) **SnapshotComparison.tsx line 8**: Change import source from `../../hooks/usePolicies` to `../../api/types` for the `PolicySnapshot` type. The hooks file doesn't re-export this type.

(d) **SnapshotComparison.tsx line 147**: `s.version` and `s.createdBy` will now resolve from updated type. Provide fallbacks: `v{s.version ?? '?'}` and `{s.createdBy ?? 'system'}`.
